{
  "title": "Read Replica · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "읽기 트래픽 분산에 쓰는 DB 복제본이다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Read Replica</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#asynchronous-replication\">Asynchronous Replication</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#read-scaling\">Read Scaling</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#cross-region-replicas\">Cross-Region Replicas</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#replica-promotion\">Replica Promotion</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#engine-specific-replicas\">Engine-specific Replicas</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#aurora-replicas\">Aurora Replicas</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>데이터베이스</span><span>40 / 62</span></div><h1>Read Replica</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 6 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Read Replica는 원본 Database의 변경을 복제하여 읽기 Workload를 분산하는 별도 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span>다. 일반적인 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a> 복제는 비동기이므로 Replica Lag과 최신 데이터 요구를 고려해야 한다.</p><p>Replica Endpoint를 만들었다고 앱의 읽기가 자동 이동하지 않는다. 앱·Connection 설정에서 읽기 경로를 분리하고 필요한 경우 Primary에서 읽도록 설계한다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"읽기 분산과 승격\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>읽기 분산과 승격</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Read scaling</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Source DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span></strong><small>쓰기·최신 읽기</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#asynchronous-replication\">Asynchronous replication</a></strong><small>Replica Lag 가능</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Read Replica</strong><small>허용 지연의 Query</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Recovery / Migration</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Read Replica</strong><small>복제 상태 확인</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Promotion</strong><small>독립 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span>로 전환</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>New write endpoint</strong><small>앱·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> 전환</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">일반 Read Replica 승격은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> Standby의 자동 Failover와 다르다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"asynchronous-replication\"><h2>Asynchronous Replication<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#asynchronous-replication\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Source 변경이 Replica에 도착하기까지 지연될 수 있다. 주문 직후 조회처럼 Read-after-write가 중요하면 Source 읽기 또는 앱 수준 조정이 필요하다. Replica Lag을 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudwatch-metrics-and-alarms\">CloudWatch</a> 등으로 관찰한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"read-scaling\"><h2>Read Scaling<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#read-scaling\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Report·분석·조회 부하를 Replica로 보내 Source의 읽기 부하를 줄인다. 쓰기는 기본적으로 Source에서 처리한다. 복잡한 Query·Index 문제와 Writer의 쓰기 병목은 별도 최적화가 필요하다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"cross-region-replicas\"><h2>Cross-Region Replicas<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#cross-region-replicas\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>지원 Engine에서 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>으로 복제해 지역별 읽기 또는 DR을 준비한다. 전송 비용·지연·Encryption·Engine 지원 조건을 확인한다. Cross-<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>이라는 이유로 자동 Multi-<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> Active-Active가 되지는 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"replica-promotion\"><h2>Replica Promotion<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#replica-promotion\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Replica를 독립 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span>로 승격하면 새로운 쓰기 대상으로 사용할 수 있다. 기존 복제 관계와 Endpoint 전환을 계획해야 한다. 일반 Read Replica의 수동 승격은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> Standby의 자동 Failover와 다르다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"engine-specific-replicas\"><h2>Engine-specific Replicas<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#engine-specific-replicas\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a> Oracle의 Mounted Replica와 Db2 Standby처럼 읽기를 제공하지 않는 구성도 있다. 지원 복제 수·Version·License·Cross-<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a> 조건은 Engine별로 다르다. 모든 이름이 Replica인 리소스가 읽기 Query를 허용하는 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"aurora-replicas\"><h2>Aurora Replicas<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#aurora-replicas\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/#aurora-replicas\">Aurora Replica</a>는 Cluster Storage를 공유하는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/\">Aurora</a>의 Reader Compute다. 일반 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a>의 별도 Storage 복제 모델과 구조가 다르다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/\">Aurora</a> Reader Endpoint·Failover Priority·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">Auto Scaling</a>으로 읽기 용량을 관리한다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>매일 큰 Report Query가 운영 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span>를 느리게 하면 Read Replica로 분산한다. 최신 주문 확인은 Primary에서 읽고 Report에서는 허용 가능한 지연을 명시한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>가용성만 요구하는 질문과 읽기 처리량 요구를 구별한다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AmazonRDS/latest/UserGuide/USER_ReadRepl.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AmazonRDS/latest/UserGuide/USER_ReadRepl.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q054/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q054\" data-question=\"Q054\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q054</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q054/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Can the standby instance of a standard RDS Multi-AZ DB instance deployment serve read queries?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q054\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes. Every standby is readable</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q054\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">No. The standby in this deployment type is for failover</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q054\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if Route 53 is used</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q054\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Yes, if the network ACL is opened</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 인스턴스의 standby는 읽기 요청을 처리하지 않는다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 클러스터와 구분한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q055\" data-question=\"Q055\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q055</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q055/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An RDS database has increasing read traffic, and the application can tolerate some replication lag. Which option most directly scales reads?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q055\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q055\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A read replica</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q055\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An additional security group</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q055\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a Multi-AZ DB instance standby</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a>가 읽기 요청을 나눈다. 보통 비동기 복제 지연을 고려한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q057\" data-question=\"Q057\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q057</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q057/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An Aurora application must separate read queries from its writer and distribute them across replicas. Which endpoint should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q057\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only the writer endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q057\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A NAT gateway Elastic IP</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q057\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The reader endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q057\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS volume ID</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/\">Aurora</a>의 reader endpoint는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">읽기 복제본</a>으로 연결을 분산한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/aurora/\">Aurora</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q087\" data-question=\"Q087\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0,4\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q087</span><span class=\"type-label\">2개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q087/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to improve both availability and read throughput for an existing RDS DB instance. Which TWO options address these goals?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q087\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A Multi-AZ DB instance deployment</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q087\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">NAT Gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q087\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A single Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q087\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Glacier Deep Archive</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"answer-Q087\" value=\"4\"><span class=\"option-letter\">E</span><span lang=\"en\">A read replica</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A, E</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 인스턴스는 장애 조치, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a>는 읽기 확장에 맞춘다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/replica/\">Read Replica</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q056\" data-question=\"Q056\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q056</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q056/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An RDS DB instance needs automatic failover, but read scaling is not required. Which deployment should be selected?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q056\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a read replica</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q056\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">S3 Versioning</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q056\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">DynamoDB DAX</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q056\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">A Multi-AZ DB instance deployment</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">Multi-AZ</a> DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 인스턴스 standby는 고가용성을 위한 선택이다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">RDS Multi-AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/rds/\">RDS</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/multiaz/\">이전 용어 <b>RDS Multi-AZ</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">다음 용어 <b>Region</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
